      "next": "n8_tiffany_calm"
    },
    {
      "id": "n8_tiffany_calm",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Tiffany",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "pose": "default_smile",
      "text": "One last time. Let's make it beautiful.",
      "next": "n9_converge_tiffany"
    },
    {
      "id": "n9_converge_tiffany",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "tiffany",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.3,
      "next": "n11"
    },
    {
      "id": "n10",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "hanami",
      "pose": "gentle",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n11"
    },
    {
      "id": "n11",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You remember what she said. \"Music never really ends. It just... resonates.\" Her words hang in the air.",
      "next": "n13"
    },
    {
      "id": "n12",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "hanami",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.3,
      "next": "n13"
    },
    {
      "id": "n13",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n14"
    },
    {
      "id": "n14",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Cassian",
      "character": "cassian",
      "pose": "neutral",
      "text": "For everyone who ever needed a song.",
      "next": "n15"
    },
    {
      "id": "n15",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He's sincere for once. No smirk, no edge. Just a musician about to play his heart out.",
      "next": "n16"
    },
    {
      "id": "n16",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "cassian",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.3,
      "next": "n17"
    },
    {
      "id": "n17",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "show_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "happy",
      "transition": "fade",
      "duration": 0.5,
      "next": "n18"
    },
    {
      "id": "n18",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "Laura",
      "character": "laura",
      "pose": "happy",
      "text": "I'm not afraid anymore.",
      "next": "n19"
    },
    {
      "id": "n19",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And she means it. Every word.",
      "next": "n20"
    },
    {
      "id": "n20",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "hide_character",
      "character": "laura",
      "transition": "fade_out",
      "duration": 0.3,
      "next": "n21"
    },
    {
      "id": "n21",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We take our positions. The room falls silent. Every eye is on us.",
      "next": "n22"
    },
    {
      "id": "n22",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "play_sound",
      "sound": "assets/sounds/countdown_beep.wav",
      "volume": 0.4,
      "next": "n23"
    },
    {
      "id": "n23",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A breath. A beat. And then—",
      "next": "n24"
    },
    {
      "id": "n24",
      "type": "game",
      "song": "dissonance_finale_generated",
      "next": "n25"
    },
    {
      "id": "n25",
      "type": "if",
      "condition": "tiffany_trust >= 4 and cassian_trust >= 4 and hanami_trust >= 3 and laura_trust >= 3",
      "trueNode": "n26_ovation",
      "falseNode": "n26_bittersweet"
    },
    {
      "id": "n26_ovation",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The last chord rings out — and for a single, breathless second, the world is perfectly still.",
      "next": "n27_ovation"
    },
    {
      "id": "n27_ovation",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "flash",
      "color": "#FFFFFF",
      "duration": 0.8,
      "next": "n28_ovation"
    },
    {
      "id": "n28_ovation",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then the applause crashes over us like a wave. People are standing. The principal is standing. Everyone is on their feet.",
      "next": "n29_ovation"
    },
    {
      "id": "n29_ovation",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I look at the others. There is a space next to Cassian where she should be. Cassian is pretending he isn't crying. Laura is beaming. Tiffany...",
      "next": "n30_ovation"
    },
    {
      "id": "n30_ovation",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tiffany is just... smiling. A real smile. Like she finally found what she was looking for.",
      "next": "n35_converge"
    },
    {
      "id": "n26_bittersweet",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The last chord fades. The applause comes — warm, genuine — but there's something underneath it.",
      "next": "n27_bittersweet"
    },
    {
      "id": "n27_bittersweet",
      "type": "action",
      "action": "flash",
      "color": "#FFFFFF",
      "duration": 0.6,
      "next": "n28_bittersweet"
    },
    {
      "id": "n28_bittersweet",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The music was beautiful. But if you looked closely, you could see the cracks. The places where we almost fell apart.",
      "next": "n29_bittersweet"
    },
    {
      "id": "n29_bittersweet",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Maybe that's what made it real. The imperfection. The dissonance that never quite resolved.",
      "next": "n35_converge"
    },
    {
      "id": "n35_converge",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It's over. The song. The performance. Maybe everything.",
      "next": "n36"
    },
    {
      "id": "n36",
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But right now, standing in this room with these people, the silence after the music feels like the most beautiful sound in the world.",
      "next": "n37"
    },
    {
      "id": "n37",
